Second pass… beside Upscale… (a painted picture, not an upscale's nor Qwen-Image 2.1's): ×1.5 and ×2 with the size each makes, how much it may change (0.5 first, kept); the draw is the run's own painter, fine-tune, adapters, prompt, seed and shape with the form's sampling when the form paints with that painter; Again keeps its size; its line says «second pass ×N». Seven strings in the eleven catalogs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
